secure and scalable file storage platform}{\rtlch\afs22 \ltrch\hich\af8\loch\f8\loch
, similar to Google Drive, where users can }{\rtlch\afs22 \ltrch\hich\af8\loch\cs15\rtlch\ab \ltrch\loch\b\f8\loch
