 for handling file uploads, renaming, deletion, and sharing.}
\par \pard\plain \s138\loch\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl240\slmult1\sb200\sa120{\rtlch\afs22 \ltrch\hich\af8\loch\f8\loch
Each user has their own }{\rtlch\afs22 \ltrch\hich\af8\loch\cs15\rtlch\ab \ltrch\loch\b\f8\loch
storage quota}{\rtlch\afs22 \ltrch\hich\af8\loch\f8\loch
, and the system checks available space before uploading. I also added a }{\rtlch\afs22 \ltrch\hich\af8\loch\cs15\rtlch\ab \ltrch\loch\b\f8\loch
temporary share link feature}{\rtlch\afs22 \ltrch\hich\af8\loch\f8\loch
, which generates a secure link that expires after 5 minutes \uc2 \u8212\'81\'5c similar to presigned URLs in AWS S3.\uc1 }
